---
config:
  layout: elk
---
stateDiagram
  direction LR
  state Configuring {
    direction TB
    [*] --> Idle:Initial Config State
    Idle --> AddingInput:addInput()
    AddingInput --> Idle:Success / Error
    Idle --> AddingOutput:addOutput()
    AddingOutput --> Idle:Success / Error
    Idle --> AddingMF:addTriangularMF() / addTrapezoidalMF()
    AddingMF --> Idle:Returns FuzzyResult
    Idle --> AddingRule:addRule()
    AddingRule --> Idle:Returns FuzzyResult
[*]    Idle
    AddingInput
    AddingOutput
    AddingMF
    AddingRule
  }
  [*] --> Created:new AutoFuzzy()
  Created --> Configuring:addInput() / addOutput()
  Configuring --> Ready:Configuration complete (implicit)
  Ready --> Evaluating:evaluate() called
  Evaluating --> Ready:Calculation Done
  Ready --> Tuning:autoTune() called
  Tuning --> Ready:Tuning Complete
  Evaluating --> Error_NoRulesFired:No rules fired
  Error_NoRulesFired --> Ready:resultValue = default
  Evaluating --> Error_DivideByZero:weightSum < epsilon
  Error_DivideByZero --> Ready:resultValue = default
  Ready --> Configuring:Reset / Reconfiguration
  Ready --> [*]:System terminated (optional cleanup)
  note right of Idle
  System is being defined.
            Variables, Membership Functions, and Rules
            are incrementally added. Errors return codes.
  end note
  note right of Evaluating
  Runs rule inference:
        - Loops through rules
        - Calculates wᵢ
        - Computes centroids
        - Aggregates output
  end note
  note right of Tuning
  Genetic algorithm steps:
        1. Mutate MF params
        2. Evaluate fitness
        3. Select best solution
  end note
